  (text "Interface select (solder jumpers, default = I2C):"
    (at 25.4 20.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "7ccc5f9d-ae21-59f7-97d8-fed4188ae232"))
  (text "  I2C (Qwiic): JP2 open, JP3 open.   UART-SHTP: bridge JP3 only.   UART-RVC: bridge JP2 only."
    (at 25.4 24.13 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "442e2ef8-fd79-5d74-804f-09794228e247"))
  (text "BNO08x I2C is unreliable on ESP32/ESP32-S3 (clock stretching). UART-SHTP (3 Mbaud) is the safe choice."
    (at 25.4 26.67 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "53c9180b-070c-5d26-8e0c-0a5f7d8549f4"))
  (text "In UART mode the Qwiic pins carry UART - do NOT plug the Qwiic port into the I2C bus then."
    (at 25.4 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4f40d0c1-0178-57ce-a74b-11f64be83361"))
  (text "UART wiring to OpenTank expansion header: TX -> GPIO8, RX -> GPIO7, RST -> GPIO42, INT optional."
    (at 25.4 33.02 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "682784cd-bb9b-5918-a791-fab0491285a8"))
  (text "Never wire anything with a pull-up to GPIO45 (ESP32-S3 boot strap pin)."
    (at 25.4 36.83 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "fcb03d80-9254-5a6f-a674-f32e54152fbb"))
  (text "I2C address 0x4B default, bridge JP1 for 0x4A. JP4/JP5 add 2.2k pull-ups (main board already has them)."
    (at 25.4 40.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "65c9ed45-bb50-5bf4-af05-c1ecf8417c4b"))
  (text "Crystal load caps per SparkFun Qwiic BNO080 reference (22 pF for a 12.5 pF crystal)."
    (at 25.4 43.18 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "fd4fead5-34ec-5df8-9643-19089c1a05f3"))
